{"id": "boe-2026-06-04-008", "date": "2026-06-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["boe"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["delay"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Meta said to delay its OLED microdisplay VR headset to 2027, more details emerge", "content": "<p>Last year we <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/meta-adopt-oled-microdisplays-2026-quest-vr-headset-supplied-seeya-and-boe\">reported</a> that Meta is said to be working on a new Quest VR headset, powered by OLED microdisplays, that will be supplied by both BOE and Seeya. It was believed that Meta aims to release the headset in 2026, and now we hear that Meta will likely delay the launch to 2027, and some more interesting specifications have surfaced.</p><p class=\"text-align-center\"><img src=\"", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/meta-said-delay-its-oled-microdisplay-vr-headset-2027-more-details-emerge", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-04-009", "date": "2026-06-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Universal Display opens up a new OLED technology and innovation center in Chengdu, China", "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/universal_display_udc\">Universal Display Corporation</a> announced that its OLED Technology and Innovation Center in Chengdu, China, is now open. UDC says that this new center marks the company's continued expansion in the region and its commitment to supporting the next phase of OLED innovation.</p><img data-entity-uuid=\"759f3997-6cdc-4e1a-874e-44628e85bffa\" data-entity-type=\"file\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/UDC-Chengdu", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/universal-display-opens-new-oled-technology-and-innovation-center-chengdu-china", "type": "rss"}]}
